&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager (ShelfView)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scandit gives people superpowers. We are looking for a product manager to own ShelfView, our retail shelf-monitoring product, from discovery through launch. You will work with engineering, design &amp;amp; sales, and you will be based in our Zurich&amp;nbsp;office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Own the roadmap and the backlog.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Talk to customers every week.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
